# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gazzetta Governor — Contradiction Synthesis Service
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Managed by systemd on gazzetta-prod VM.
# Timer: gazzetta-governor.timer (every 10 min)
#
# Install:
#   sudo cp ops/gazzetta-governor.service /etc/systemd/system/
#   sudo cp ops/gazzetta-governor.timer /etc/systemd/system/
#   sudo systemctl daemon-reload
#   sudo systemctl enable --now gazzetta-governor.timer
#
# Logs:
#   journalctl -u gazzetta-governor -f -n 50
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

[Unit]
Description=Gazzetta di Kyiv — Contradiction Synthesizer
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=gazzetta
Group=gazzetta
WorkingDirectory=/opt/gazzetta-di-kyiv

# Environment file (DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN, ALPHAVANTAGE_API_KEY)
EnvironmentFile=/opt/gazzetta-di-kyiv/.env

# Pipeline scripts — sequential, each inherits traffic_cop lock
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 scripts/ingestion_triage.py
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 scripts/market_reality.py --all
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 scripts/contradiction_synthesizer.py

# Security hardening
NoNewPrivileges=yes
PrivateTmp=yes
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=yes
ReadWritePaths=/opt/gazzetta-di-kyiv/data /opt/gazzetta-di-kyiv/public/data
ReadOnlyPaths=/opt/gazzetta-di-kyiv

# Resource limits
MemoryMax=512M
CPUQuota=200%

# Fail fast — systemd will retry per timer
TimeoutStartSec=600
Restart=no

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
